OL,3,GNEWSAPolice reopen investigation into
OL,4,Adumped letters discovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police have reopened an
OL,7,Finvestigation into how hundreds of
OL,8,Funopened letters came to be dumped on a
OL,9,Fcountry road near Londonderry.
OL,11,FAn estimated 600 unopened letters were
OL,12,Fhanded into Social Democratic and
OL,13,FLabour Party (SDLP) MLA Mark H Durkan's
OL,14,Fconstituency office earlier this month.
OL,16,FThe majority ` around 400 letters `
OL,17,Fwere found by a member of the public on
OL,18,FMobouy Road, with more discovered later
OL,19,Fin the Victoria Road area.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
