OL,3,GNEWSAPolice reopen investigation into
OL,4,Adumped letters discovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) previously said it had completed
OL,8,Fits enquiries and the matter had been
OL,9,F"fully handed over to Royal Mail", but
OL,10,Fin an updated statement on Wednesday,
OL,11,Fit said that, "upon review", it was
OL,12,F"now progressing enquiries".
